{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1399297-wonder-forging-genius-is-unbelievably-stupid-who-is-it-designed-for","id":1399297,"title":"Wonder Forging Genius is unbelievably stupid, who is it designed for?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-06-27T08:53:53-07:00","id":1399297,"title":"Wonder Forging Genius is unbelievably stupid, who is it designed for?","content":"This is a craft charm deep in the tree, E5, and only one charm away from the capstone (of that branch). Here's what it does<br /> <br /> <i>if you have <u>10 or more</u> <b>Legendary Projects</b></i> u<i>nderway, you can instantly finish one of them</i>. <br /> <br /> Holy goddamn. Legendary projects, Artifacts and Manses of N/A rarity, a step beyond Rank 5. But wait, there's a lesser effect:<br /> <br /> <i>If you have 10 artifacts of the same rank going at once, you can instantly finish one. </i><br /> <br /> Who is this for. No really, putting aside our feelings about craft xp and power charms and everything, really think about this: you need to have 10 <b><i>simultaneous</i></b> world altering projects going at the same time to use it, and this is from the setting that says &quot;you shouldn't be cranking out artifacts every week. each one is its own custom legend&quot;. Was this even used in the First Age?<br /> <br /> When we bring the mechanics into it, its even worse. it costs 5 <b>White XP</b> (the highest kind) to make a Legendary slot, and 10 White XP to roll <i>once</i> against a goal of 200. so you would have to pay 50 wxp just to open these projects up, even though that would be enough to finish one project of <i><u><b>world shaking consequences.</b></u></i> And you are expected to get your hands on <b>TEN. AT THE SAME TIME</b>. <br /> <br /> Just for reference, the book says that Rank 4 Artifacts are enough to start wars over, and Rank 5 Artifacts can change the fate of nations. So even if we are being generous, you would need to be working on ten different casus bellis (which also have a start up investment) and just hanging on to them before you could use this charm. This is almost exactly how the game <i>doesnt</i> want you to play, not to mention even getting that many design slots requires a separate purchase with Craft XP, or a charm you are supposed to buy several times over to unlock those spaces, <i>which isnt a prerequisite for this charm</i>. <br /> <br /> Oh, and if you wanted to cheese it, which honestly is a bigger investment than just actually making the thing you wanted, you have to finish <i><b>half of all your current projects of that level</b></i> before you can use it again. You can't abandon your fake projects to cheat the charm. If you could finish a project in 1 roll each (you cant), Congratulations! you only spent 50 wxp for the rolls and 25 more to open up new projects, again I cant state this enough, projects of <b>World Changing Power</b>. Would you even need another one at this point? Oh, and if you somehow <i>could</i>, hypothetically, finish an Artifact N/A project in one roll- why bother buying this charm in the first place? You could have just made the thing you wanted before hand. Assuming you could get up to an average 50 successes per roll, it would take 4 rolls per project, for 5 projects, to refresh this charm. that's <b>200 White Experience Points</b> that need to be spent between uses. <br /> <br /> 5. You need to finish 5 different War Starting Artifacts, enough to kit out a whole circle with character-defining power, before you are allowed to handwave another one as being done in your free time. and not only that, I hope you don't have artifacts of different power levels in mind: <b><i>all ten of them</i></b> <i><b>have to be the same rank</b></i>. You don't even get to pull out the lowest rank, no, they have to be the same rank. <br /> <br /> Just for reference, you could save yourself 5 whole charms and not buy this, because one of its pre-reqs, <u><i>Vice-Miracle Technique</i></u>, lets you just pull a 2 or 3 dot artifact from your utility belt- except you don't have to declare it first, you can retcon in exaclty what you need that the moment you need it, once <b>per story.</b><br /> <br /> Oh and the charm after it? Has nothing to do with Legendary Artifacts and juggling world changing wonders. its <b><u>Dual Magus Prana</u></b>, the cool and powerful charm that let's you retcon your own death after the fact as being just a fake version of you. So if you want one of the coolest charms in the game, you need to buy this... strange charm from the brainstorming session that never got cut. <br /> <br /> I had to get that off my chest. I'd like to hear some other people's take on this bizarrely useless charm.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Please be warned: this is not champagne, this is most likely a duck.<br /> -<i>Chausse</i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#800080\"><i>Message me for Japanese translations.</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8830-sorcerous-overlord","name":"Sorcerous Overlord","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8830_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-27T09:19:24-07:00","id":1399302,"title":"","content":"First, Craft is a dumpster fire.<br /> Second, <a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/exalted/comments/8nioxo/craft_system_3rd_edition_why_people_went_crazy/\" target=\"_blank\">Craft is a dumpster fire</a>. For real.<br /> <br /> A starting Twilight can reliably crap out N/A artifacts. May as well buy up God-Forge Within -- by Essence 5, you can have 10 free, permanent Legendary slots and enough Power charms to finish each one in a single roll. It only takes 204 successes, you can throw a thousand successes on a well heeled Solar Craft roll.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":531,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","user":"JohnDoe244","date":". 06-27-2020, 12:36 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-27T09:59:15-07:00","id":1399310,"title":"","content":"How are you hitting 1000 successes? The most I've ever been able to land is like 190ish in a single roll.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24587-yamajin","name":"Yamajin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24587_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"25"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-27T11:11:16-07:00","id":1399321,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sorcerous Overlord</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1399297-wonder-forging-genius-is-unbelievably-stupid-who-is-it-designed-for#post1399297\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I had to get that off my chest. I'd like to hear some other people's take on this bizarrely useless charm.</div> </div> </div> </div>There's a reason that I have a homebrewed Craft system in my signature.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1520732-forged-by-purpose-alchemicals-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Forged By Purpose: The Alchemicals</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1413451-dead-but-not-gone-ghosts\" target=\"_blank\">Dead But Not Gone: Ghosts</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/228291-ghosts-a-revision-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Ghosts: A Revision</a> (2nd Edition)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/316-masters-of-the-industrial-elements-2e-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Masters of the Industrial Elements</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1157362-from-the-crucible-crafting-as-a-struggle-peach\" target=\"_blank\">\u200bFrom The Crucible: Crafting As A Struggle</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/74-kyeudo","name":"Kyeudo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar74_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1723"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-27T11:29:20-07:00","id":1399327,"title":"","content":"Using Void circle necromancy to resurrect a dead horse 5 years after its death sounds like a perfectly irresponsible use of cosmic power.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1311230-badassoverlord-s-assorted-homebrew-folder\" target=\"_blank\">Are you in the market for some Martial Arts? Perhaps some custom Artifacts for your campaign?</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10131-badassoverlord","name":"BadassOverlord","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10131_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"322"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-27T11:36:48-07:00","id":1399332,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BadassOverlord</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1399297-wonder-forging-genius-is-unbelievably-stupid-who-is-it-designed-for?p=1399327#post1399327\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Using Void circle necromancy to resurrect a dead horse 5 years after its death sounds like a perfectly irresponsible use of cosmic power.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> It's a bit like this: <a href=\"https://xkcd.com/1053/\" target=\"_blank\">https://xkcd.com/1053/</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1520732-forged-by-purpose-alchemicals-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Forged By Purpose: The Alchemicals</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1413451-dead-but-not-gone-ghosts\" target=\"_blank\">Dead But Not Gone: Ghosts</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/228291-ghosts-a-revision-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Ghosts: A Revision</a> (2nd Edition)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/316-masters-of-the-industrial-elements-2e-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Masters of the Industrial Elements</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1157362-from-the-crucible-crafting-as-a-struggle-peach\" target=\"_blank\">\u200bFrom The Crucible: Crafting As A Struggle</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/74-kyeudo","name":"Kyeudo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar74_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1723"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-27T15:17:05-07:00","id":1399405,"title":"","content":"Yes, the Solar Charm set is, RAW, bad.<br /> <br /> That said, I think the OP's analysis of things is really off.<br /> <br /> Cxp, even wxp is not something Solar Craft specialists worry about. One of the broken parts of Solar Craft is how many points Solars can generate combined with a Charm that lets them move points around. With the right situation, CNNT and the start of the Momentum tree, I could probably get 1/4 of the cxp I need to fuel Wonder Forging Genius's requirement of 10 Legendary slots full in a single scene. It's just not a huge deal.<br /> <br /> Because of that the biggest control on Legendary projects is really time. The game assumes it takes a very large amount of time to amass the materials necessary to start a Legendary project. There's a Charm to guarantee it only takes a few months. After that, the roll interval is 10 years. If you don't make your 200 successes on the first try, you need to wait a decade of in-universe time before you try again.<br /> <br /> This is a particular issue because a lot of people don't play in games that have regular decade long down times between adventures; even with the long life spans of the Exalted. The Time of Tumult is designed to have a lot of action hooks, so people want to go do things, not have lots of down time between adventures for Creation to move on without them.<br /> <br /> So that's what - however bad the design that makes it a valid point - this Charm is really about. Letting a player get a Legendary project done within the time scale a lot of games use. Without it, a lot of Craft specialists wouldn't get to finish a single one, because their game's gone on for five stories, played for two years of real world time, and maybe five years have passed in-character. They're drowning in cxp, but no Legendary project is getting finished any time soon. This Charm lets you get one.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-27T15:23:49-07:00","id":1399407,"title":"","content":"Who is it designed for?<br /> <br /> <br /> No one, really. <br /> <br /> The solar craft set has very little salvageable. Maybe 15% of it is useful and the rest is either trash, useless or bizarre.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse/visitormessage/1408635-visitor-message-from-synapse#post1408635\" target=\"_blank\">Check my Exalted homebrew</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse","name":"Synapse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar32_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1507"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-27T15:35:06-07:00","id":1399410,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BadassOverlord</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1399297-wonder-forging-genius-is-unbelievably-stupid-who-is-it-designed-for?p=1399327#post1399327\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Using Void circle necromancy to resurrect a dead horse 5 years after its death sounds like a perfectly irresponsible use of cosmic power.</div> </div> </div> </div><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1397650-jay-dizzle-whinges-about-triple-attack-technique/page2\">Thank god no one else is discussing dead horses right now</a>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Please be warned: this is not champagne, this is most likely a duck.<br /> -<i>Chausse</i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#800080\"><i>Message me for Japanese translations.</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8830-sorcerous-overlord","name":"Sorcerous Overlord","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8830_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-27T15:57:41-07:00","id":1399416,"title":"","content":"I think it was written on the assumption that people would have all those extra craft slot charms nobody bothers with.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-27T16:40:38-07:00","id":1399424,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1399297-wonder-forging-genius-is-unbelievably-stupid-who-is-it-designed-for?p=1399405#post1399405\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Because of that the biggest control on Legendary projects is really time. The game assumes it takes a very large amount of time to amass the materials necessary to start a Legendary project. There's a Charm to guarantee it only takes a few months. After that, the roll interval is 10 years. If you don't make your 200 successes on the first try, you need to wait a decade of in-universe time before you try again.</div> </div> </div> </div>You need to go back and re-read the rules. Ten years is the normal time you have to wait before you can start rolling to complete, but after that Craft project rolls have no fixed intervals. You can explicitly try again as soon as you have the craft points to pay. Using Thousand Forge Hands tosses that ten year start interval out the door, so Wonder Forging Genius ends up neutered.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1520732-forged-by-purpose-alchemicals-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Forged By Purpose: The Alchemicals</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1413451-dead-but-not-gone-ghosts\" target=\"_blank\">Dead But Not Gone: Ghosts</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/228291-ghosts-a-revision-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Ghosts: A Revision</a> (2nd Edition)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/316-masters-of-the-industrial-elements-2e-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Masters of the Industrial Elements</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1157362-from-the-crucible-crafting-as-a-struggle-peach\" target=\"_blank\">\u200bFrom The Crucible: Crafting As A Struggle</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/74-kyeudo","name":"Kyeudo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar74_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1723"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-29T00:12:59-07:00","id":1399747,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1399297-wonder-forging-genius-is-unbelievably-stupid-who-is-it-designed-for?p=1399405#post1399405\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yes, the Solar Charm set is, RAW, bad.<br /> <br /> That said, I think the OP's analysis of things is really off.<br /> <br /> Cxp, even wxp is not something Solar Craft specialists worry about. One of the broken parts of Solar Craft is how many points Solars can generate combined with a Charm that lets them move points around. With the right situation, CNNT and the start of the Momentum tree, I could probably get 1/4 of the cxp I need to fuel Wonder Forging Genius's requirement of 10 Legendary slots full in a single scene. It's just not a huge deal.</div> </div> </div> </div>Correct. Agree. Apologies for being unclear.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Because of that the biggest control on Legendary projects is really time. The game assumes it takes a very large amount of time to amass the materials necessary to start a Legendary project. There's a Charm to guarantee it only takes a few months. After that, the roll interval is 10 years. If you don't make your 200 successes on the first try, you need to wait a decade of in-universe time before you try again. </div> </div> </div>Incorrect. Superior and Legendary projects have no set Interval. Page 241/242:<br /> <br /> &quot;The roll [for Superior projects] has no set interval; each time the character pays 10 gold points to attempt to complete the project, she can roll once, and may attempt her next roll once she can pay another 10 gold points to try again.<br /> <br /> [...]<br /> <br /> &quot;Attempting to finish a legendary project works like attempting to finish a superior project, with the following exceptions: The character must labor for at least ten years, attempting to finish costs 10 white points, and the extended roll to finish the project has a goal number of 200.&quot;<br /> <br /> That said, putting a decade long Interval on the project might be a pretty decent speed bump.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-30T11:17:51-07:00","id":1400141,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sorcerous Overlord</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1399297-wonder-forging-genius-is-unbelievably-stupid-who-is-it-designed-for?p=1399410#post1399410\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1397650-jay-dizzle-whinges-about-triple-attack-technique/page2\">Thank god no one else is discussing dead horses right now</a>.</div> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">I'll do the sarcasm around here, thank you.</span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&